      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this for bridge/device behind bridge? I\u0027m a bit confused as the commit message mentions a different API for bridged devices.",
      "revId": "4535998590234969adb4ad58c1fb89d1ffaaf006",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
